# `En1990Mutation` op frame (`semio_s_artifact_norm_contract::payload_op_binary`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`), then
# `tag u8`, then the leaf payload (`Mutation::payload_value`) as canonical UTF-8 JSON to the end of the op. Each record is
# one mutation kind at its wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, looked up by the kind's semantic kind.
